# AgriFresh - 3D Spatial Architecture & System Implementation Plan (SIH 2026 - SIH26033)

AgriFresh is a 3D spatial web platform for the Ministry of Consumer Affairs, Food & Public Distribution. It integrates **Solar-Powered Micro-Cold Hubs**, **IoT Telemetry Nodes**, **AI Dynamic Heat Corridor Bypass Logistics**, **Autonomous MCP (Model Context Protocol) AI Agents**, and **Web3 Smart Escrow Contracts** to prevent post-harvest decay, eliminate distress sales, and provide direct farmer payouts.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Framework & 3D Stack**: Built with Next.js (App Router), React Three Fiber (`@react-three/fiber`), Drei (`@react-three/drei`), Three.js, Framer Motion, and Tailwind CSS.
> - **Procedural 3D Model Fallback**: `ColdHubCanvas` implements procedural 3D geometry (modular container, solar panels, cooling compressor, status LEDs, terrain, foliage) to guarantee instant rendering without external model loading delays.
> - **Git Remote**: Will initialize Git and push all completed code to `https://github.com/priyanshu-sarjan/VEXITE-HACK-INNOVATE-Farmer-Consumer-Bond.git` on branch `main`.

