## Key Features & Architecture

### 1. Visual & Spatial Design System
- **Palette**: Dark matte slate (`#121316`, `#1e2025`), deep charcoal (`#0a0b0d`), emerald accent glow (`#10b981`), frosted glass surfaces.
- **Glassmorphism**: `backdrop-blur-xl bg-neutral-900/60 border border-white/10 shadow-2xl rounded-2xl`.
- **Micro-Animations**: Mouse parallax, 3D tilt cards, fluid drawer transitions, live pulse beacons.

### 2. Core Modules
1. **Interactive 3D Cold Hub Viewport (`components/canvas/ColdHubCanvas.jsx`)**:
   - Procedural 3D solar micro-cold hub on lush terrain.
   - Mouse parallax camera rig using `useFrame`.
   - Clickable 3D hotspots (Internal Chamber Temp, Solar PV Array, Ethylene Scrubber, Gate-In Lock).
2. **Interactive Configurator (`components/ui/InteractiveConfigurator.jsx`)**:
   - Floating right drawer and bottom dock for model selector (10MT Micro-Hub vs 20MT Solar Reefer vs 50MT Macro Hub), capacity load simulator, and quick Web3 buy/reserve actions.
3. **IoT Telemetry Overlay (`components/iot/TelemetryOverlay.jsx`)**:
   - Real-time ESP32 telemetry HUD (GPS, Temp °C, RH%, Ethylene PPM, Decay Shelf-Life Index).
   - Active transit shipment switcher syncing 3D canvas state.
4. **Autonomous MCP AI Agent Hub (`components/mcp/MCPAgentTerminal.jsx`)**:
   - Terminal interface exposing MCP tools (`get_mandi_prices`, `check_iot_shelf_life`, `reserve_cold_hub_slot`, `trigger_escrow_release`).
   - Autonomous execution timeline & price anomaly detector.
5. **AI Route & Heat Bypass Logistics (`components/logistics/RouteOptimizer.jsx`)**:
   - Real-time route optimization bypassing ambient heat corridors and traffic bottlenecks to extend crop shelf life.
6. **Web3 Smart Escrow & Direct Payouts (`components/web3/SmartEscrow.jsx`)**:
   - Wallet connection & 4-stage automated escrow contract verification upon IoT gate-in.

